{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106043","id":2496536117,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Uzh41","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106043","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106043.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106043.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106043","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106043/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106043/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106043/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c1cc36e9e529883704aea733595719f55f862b1f","number":106043,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix NaN saturation when converting white to OKHSV ","user":{"login":"maxcomperatore","id":131000419,"node_id":"U_kgDOB87oYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131000419?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore","html_url":"https://github.com/maxcomperatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"fixes #106006. converting white (rgb 1,1,1) to okhsv was returning nan for saturation due to a divide-by-zero when chroma is zero. this happens because lab.a and lab.b are both zero for white, so chroma is zero, and the code tries to normalize it anyway.\n\nthis adds a check for near-zero chroma (less than 1e-8) and returns sensible default values instead. hue is set to 0 (arbitrary), saturation to 0, and value is based on luminance from the lab color.\n\nthis avoids floating point exceptions and gives stable output for grayscale colors. fix is minimal and isolated.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-03T00:07:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T20:32:00Z","closed_at":"2025-06-15T15:22:22Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1f0135a406f8469222b3fc8d8707dc0fade66f64","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","st